# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Old "areas we cover" town pages that compete with the town pages on
# thedegreegap.com/study/. Each one goes, permanently, to the page for the
# same town there, and only where that exact town has a page. List and
# reasons: docs/old-location-redirects.md in the study site repo.
#
# Each rule matches one exact address (with or without a trailing slash) and
# nothing else, so no subject page and nothing below these addresses is
# touched.
#
# Paste this block into the main site's root .htaccess, straight after the
# first "RewriteEngine on" line, so it runs before the rule that hands every
# request to public/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RewriteRule ^areas-we-cover/aldershot-gcse-a-level-tutoring/?$ https://thedegreegap.com/study/locations/aldershot-tutors/ [R=301,L,NC]
RewriteRule ^areas-we-cover/bicester-gcse-a-level-tutoring/?$ https://thedegreegap.com/study/locations/bicester-tutors/ [R=301,L,NC]
RewriteRule ^areas-we-cover/birmingham-gcse-a-level-tutoring/?$ https://thedegreegap.com/study/locations/birmingham-tutors/ [R=301,L,NC]
